---
layout: base.njk
title: "Locations | Zunkiree Labs Service Areas"
description: "Zunkiree Labs serves clients across Nepal and globally. Our headquarters is in Kathmandu, with service coverage throughout the Kathmandu Valley and beyond."
permalink: /locations/
bodyClass: "v2-inter"
hideChrome: true
---

{# =====================================================
   LOCATIONS INDEX PAGE — v2 visual language (navy/sky/#76B900
   glass system, mono uppercase eyebrows, rounded-xl cards),
   matching the industry.njk / resources index.njk pattern.
   Individual /locations/{id}/ pages (location.njk layout) are
   out of scope for this pass.
   ===================================================== #}

{% include "partials/navbar-v2.njk" %}

<script>
  document.documentElement.classList.add('js-reveal-hidden');
</script>
<style>
  .js-reveal-hidden [data-reveal]:not(.revealed),
  .js-reveal-hidden [data-reveal-stagger]:not(.revealed) > * {
    opacity: 0;
  }
</style>

{# =====================================================
   HERO — centered single-column, matches industry.njk's hero
   shell (mono eyebrow chip + headline + subhead) on a plain
   white ground.
   ===================================================== #}
<section class="relative flex flex-col items-center justify-center px-4 pb-8 pt-32 sm:px-6 sm:pt-36 lg:px-8 lg:pt-40" aria-labelledby="hero-heading">
  <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto flex max-w-[56rem] flex-col items-center text-center" data-reveal-stagger>
    <span class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-sky-100/60 bg-sky-50/60 px-3.5 py-1.5 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-sky-600 shadow-subtle">
      Locations
    </span>

    <h1 id="hero-heading" class="text-center text-[34px] font-medium leading-[1.15] tracking-tight text-[#111827] sm:text-[42px] sm:leading-[1.1] lg:text-[48px]">
      Where we work
    </h1>

    <p class="mt-4 max-w-[640px] text-center text-[18px] font-medium leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280] sm:text-[20px]">
      Zunkiree Labs is headquartered in Kathmandu, Nepal, serving clients locally and globally.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

{# =====================================================
   LOCATIONS GRID — rounded-xl navy-bordered cards, same
   recipe as the accelerators feature grid on industry.njk.
   HQ badge uses the #76B900 accent instead of a decorative pill.
   ===================================================== #}
<section class="px-4 pb-12 pt-12 sm:px-6 sm:pb-16 sm:pt-16 lg:px-8" aria-labelledby="locations-grid-heading">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl">
    <h2 id="locations-grid-heading" class="sr-only">All locations</h2>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3" data-reveal-stagger>
      {% for location in locations %}
      <a href="/locations/{{ location.id }}/" class="group flex flex-col rounded-xl border border-navy-100/60 bg-white p-5 shadow-subtle transition-shadow duration-300 hover:shadow-card-hover">
        <div class="mb-3 flex items-start justify-between gap-3">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-[18px] font-semibold leading-snug text-[#111827]">
              {{ location.name }}
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-0.5 text-[13px] text-navy-400">
              {{ location.region }}, {{ location.country }}
            </p>
          </div>
          {% if location.isHeadquarters %}
          <span class="inline-flex flex-shrink-0 items-center rounded-full bg-[#76B900]/10 px-2.5 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-[#5a9100]">
            HQ
          </span>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
        <p class="text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280] line-clamp-2">
          {{ location.intro | truncate(120) }}
        </p>
        <div class="mt-4 flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wide text-sky-600 transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:translate-x-0.5">
          View location
          <svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# =====================================================
   SERVING CLIENTS GLOBALLY — sky-tinted glass panel, same
   surface recipe as the flagship-proof / platform-tie-in
   panels on industry.njk.
   ===================================================== #}
<section class="px-4 pb-12 pt-12 sm:px-6 sm:pb-16 sm:pt-16 lg:px-8" aria-labelledby="global-heading">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl">
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/60 bg-gradient-to-br from-sky-100/70 via-sky-50/30 to-white/40 p-6 shadow-subtle backdrop-blur-md sm:p-8 lg:p-10" data-reveal>
      <span class="mb-3 block font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-sky-600">Global reach</span>
      <h2 id="global-heading" class="max-w-2xl text-[24px] font-medium leading-[1.2] text-[#111827] sm:text-[28px]">
        Serving clients globally
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280]">
        While headquartered in Nepal, we work with clients worldwide. Our remote collaboration processes ensure seamless communication across time zones.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2.5">
        {% for country in ["United States", "United Kingdom", "Australia", "Germany", "Singapore", "India", "UAE"] %}
        <span class="rounded-full border border-white/50 bg-white/70 px-4 py-2 text-[13px] font-medium text-navy-700 backdrop-blur-sm">{{ country }}</span>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# =====================================================
   CLOSING CTA — dark navy + green-glow shell, matching
   industry.njk's closing CTA (COMPONENT_LIBRARY.md §2.6).
   ===================================================== #}
<section class="px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 sm:py-16 lg:px-8 lg:py-20" aria-labelledby="closing-cta-heading">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl">
    <div
      class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-[28px] bg-navy-950 px-6 py-14 text-center sm:px-12 sm:py-16"
      style="box-shadow: 0 40px 60px -25px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.45);"
      data-reveal
    >
      <div
        class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 z-0"
        aria-hidden="true"
        style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 80% at 15% 100%, rgba(118,185,0,0.20) 0%, transparent 60%), radial-gradient(ellipse 50% 70% at 100% 0%, rgba(87,119,130,0.25) 0%, transparent 60%);"
      ></div>

      <h2 id="closing-cta-heading" class="relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-2xl text-[28px] font-semibold leading-[1.2] tracking-tight text-white sm:text-[32px] lg:text-[36px]">
        Ready to work with us?
      </h2>
      <p class="relative z-10 mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xl text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-white/60">
        Whether you're in Nepal or anywhere in the world, let's discuss how we can help.
      </p>
      <div class="relative z-10 mt-8 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-3 sm:flex-row">
        <a
          href="/contact/"
          class="inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-md bg-[#76B900] px-6 py-3 font-mono text-[13px] uppercase tracking-wide text-white transition-colors duration-200 hover:bg-[#5a9100] focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[#76B900] focus-visible:ring-offset-2"
        >
          Contact us
          <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full bg-white/70" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

